n    \\\"narm\\\": false,\\n    \\\"need_sort\\\": true,\\n    \\\"operations\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"op_column\\\": \\\"5\\\",\\n        \\\"op_name\\\": \\\"mean\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"op_column\\\": \\\"6\\\",\\n        \\\"op_name\\\": \\\"mean\\\"\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"print_full_line\\\": false\\n  },\\n  \\\"validate_before_submit\\\": true\\n}\\n--- /workspace/run_trace/galaxy_tool_run/summary.json\\n{\\n  \\\"evidence_directory\\\": \\\"run_trace/galaxy_tool_run\\\",\\n  \\\"parameter_provenance\\\": {\\n    \\\"checked_parameter_count\\\": 11,\\n    \\\"mismatches\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"expected\\\": \\\"5\\\",\\n        \\\"path\\\": \\\"operations|0|op_column\\\",\\n        \\\"resolved\\\": \\\"1\\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"expected\\\": \\\"mean\\\",\\n        \\\"path\\\": \\\"operations|0|op_name\\\",\\n        \\\"resolved\\\": \\\"count\\\"\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"missing_paths\\\": [\\n      \\\"operations|1|op_column\\\",\\n      \\\"operations|1|op_name\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"mismatch\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"validation_parameter_mismatch\\\",\\n  \\\"submitted\\\": false,\\n  \\\"tool_id\\\": \\\"toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/iuc/datamash_ops/datamash_ops/1.9+galaxy0\\\",\\n  \\\"validation_status\\\": \\\"parameter_mismatch\\\"\\n}\\n--- /workspace/run_trace/galaxy_tool_run/validation_parameter_provenance.json\\n{\\n  \\\"checked_parameter_count\\\": 11,\\n  \\\"mismatches\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"expected\\\": \\\"5\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"operations|0|op_column\\\",\\n      \\\"resolved\\\": \\\"1\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"expected\\\": \\\"mean\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"operations|0|op_name\\\",\\n      \\\"resolved\\\": \\\"count\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"missing_paths\\\": [\\n    \\\"operations|1|op_column\\\",\\n    \\\"operations|1|op_name\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"mismatch\\\"\\n}\\n--- /workspace/run_trace/galaxy_tool_run/validation_response.json\\n{\\n  \\\"action\\\": \\\"/tool_runner/index\\\",\\n  \\\"citations\\\": true,\\n  \\\"creator\\\": null,\\n  \\\"credentials\\\": [],\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"(operations on tabular data)\\\",\\n  \\\"display\\\": true,\\n  \\\"edam_operations\\\": [],\\n  \\\"edam_topics\\\": [],\\n  \\\"enctype\\\": \\\"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\\\",\\n  \\\"errors\\\": {},\\n  \\\"form_style\\\": \\\"regular\\\",\\n  \\\"has_parameters\\\": true,\\n  \\\"help\\\": \\\"<p class=\\\\\\\"infomark\\\\\\\"><strong>TIP:</strong> Input data must be TAB delimited. If the desired dataset does not appear in the input list, use <em>Text Manipulation-&gt;Convert</em> to convert it to <strong>Tabular</strong> type.</p>\\\\n<hr class=\\\\\\\"docutils\\\\\\\" />\\\\n<p><strong>Syntax</strong></p>\\\\n<p>This tools performs common operations (such as summing, counting, mean, standard-deviation) on input file, based on tabular data. The tool can also optionaly group the input based on a given field.</p>\\\\n<hr class=\\\\\\\"docutils\\\\\\\" />\\\\n<p><strong>Example 1</strong></p>\\\\n<ul>\\\\n<li><p class=\\\\\\\"first\\\\\\\">Find the average score in statistics course of college students, grouped by their college major. The input file has three fields (Name,Major,Score) and a header line:</p>\\\\n<pre class=\\\\\\\"literal-block\\\\\\\">\\\\nName        Major            Score\\\\nBryan       Arts             68\\\\nGabriel     Health-Medicine  100\\\\nIsaiah      Arts             80\\\\nTysza       Business         92\\\\nZackery     Engineering      54\\\\n...\\\\n...\\\\n</pre>\\\\n</li>\\\\n<li><p class=\\\\\\\"first\\\\\\\">Grouping the input by the second column (<em>Major</em>), sorting the input, and performing operations <strong>mean</strong> and <strong>sample standard deviation</strong> on the third column (<em>Score</em>), gives:</p>\\\\n<pre class=\\\\\\\"literal-block\\\\\\\">\\\\nGroupBy(Major)     mean(Score)   sstdev(Score)\\\\nArts               68.9474       10.4215\\\\nBusiness           87.3636       5.18214\\\\nEngineering        66.5385       19.8814\\\\nHealth-Medicine    90.6154       9.22441\\\\nLife-Sciences      55.3333       20.606\\\\nSocial-Sciences    60.2667       17.2273\\\\n</pre>\\\\n</li>\\\\n</ul>\\\\n<p>Note that input needs sorting here, since the column used for grouping (<em>Major</em>) is not sorted.</p>\\\\n<p>This sample file is available at <a class=\\\\\\\"reference external\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"http://www.gnu.org/software/datamash\\\\\\\">http://www.gnu.org/software/datamash</a> .</p>\\\\n<p><strong>Example 2</strong></p>\\\\n<ul>\\\\n<li><p class=\\\\\\\"first\\\\\\\">Using the UCSC RefSeq Human Gene Track, available at: <a class=\\\\\\\"reference external\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"http://hgdownload.soe.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg38/database/refGene.txt.gz\\\\\\\">http://hgdownload.soe.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg38/database/refGene.txt.gz</a></p>\\\\n</li>\\\\n<li><p class=\\\\\\\"first\\\\\\\">List the number and identifiers of isoforms per gene. The gene identifier is in column 13, the isoform/transcript identifier is in column 2. Grouping by column 13 and performing <strong>count</strong> and <strong>Combine all values</strong> on column 2, gives:</p>\\\\n<pre class=\\\\\\\"literal-block\\\\\\\">\\\\nGroupBy(field-13)     count(field-2)     collapse(field-2)\\\\nA1BG                  1                  NM_130786\\\\nA1BG-AS1              1                  NR_015380\\\\nA1CF                  6                  NM_001198818,NM_001198819,NM_001198820,NM_014576,NM_138932,NM_138933\\\\nA2M                   1                  NM_000014\\\\nA2M-AS1               1                  NR_026971\\\\nA2ML1                 2                  NM_001282424,NM_144670\\\\n...\\\\n</pre>\\\\n</li>\\\\n<li><p class=\\\\\\\"first\\\\\\\">Count how many transcripts are listed for each chromosome and strand. Chromosome is on column 3, Strand is in column 4. Transcript identifiers are in column 2. Grouping by columns <strong>3,4</strong> and performing operation <strong>count</strong> on column 2, gives:</p>\\\\n<pre class=\\\\\\\"literal-block\\\\\\\">\\\\nGroupBy(field-3)     GroupBy(field-4)     count(field-2)\\\\nchr1                 +                    2456\\\\nchr1                 -                    2431\\\\nchr2                 +                    1599\\\\nchr2                 -                    1419\\\\nchr3                 +                    1287\\\\nchr3                 -                    1249\\\\n...\\\\n</pre>\\\\n</li>\\\\n</ul>\\\\n<hr class=\\\\\\\"docutils\\\\\\\" />\\\\n<p><strong>GNU Datamash</strong> is a Free and Open Source Software, see more details on the <a class=\\\\\\\"reference external\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://www.gnu.org/software/datamash/\\\\\\\">Datamash</a> Website.</p>\\\\n<p>For more details about supported statistical operations, see <a class=\\\\\\\"reference external\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://www.gnu.org/software/datamash/download/\\\\\\\">https://www.gnu.org/software/datamash/download/</a></p>\\\\n<p>For more details about supported statistical operations, see <a class=\\\\\\\"reference external\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://www.gnu.org/software/datamash/\\\\\\\">Datamash</a> website.</p>\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"help_format\\\": \\\"restructuredtext\\\",\\n  \\\"hidden\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"hidden_versions\\\": [],\\n  \\\"history_id\\\": \\\"bbd44e69cb8906b5d05f57d0d9924bc9\\\",\\n  \\\"icon\\\": null,\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/iuc/datamash_ops/datamash_ops/1.9+galaxy0\\\",\\n  \\\"inputs\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"argument\\\": null,\\n      \\\"default_value\\\": {\\n        \\\"values\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"id\\\": \\\"f9cad7b01a4721353cbf15e6222ba42c\\\",\\n            \\\"src\\\": \\\"hda\\\"\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      },\\n      \\\"edam\\\": {\\n        \\\"edam_data\\\": [\\n          \\\"data_0006\\\",\\n          \\\"data_0006\\\",\\n          \\\"data_0006\\\